{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42122","headline":"爱敬寺有老僧尝游长安言秦雍间事历历可听因赠此诗兼示同行客 · 徐铉","name":"爱敬寺有老僧尝游长安言秦雍间事历历可听因赠此诗兼示同行客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首栖禅者，尝谈灞滻游。\n能令过江客，偏起失乡愁。\n室倚桃花崦，门临杜若洲。\n城中无此景，将子剩淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}